<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hope It Hurts</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Isabel LaRosa</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Raven</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3bUoP1n0LAHDW7SE7dtgtY</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.110" end="00:02.715">I'm so cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.715" end="00:07.527">I'm not in my body, I feel like a ghost</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.527" end="00:10.524">You're at home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.524" end="00:14.969">You're lyin' together, does she keep you warm?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.969" end="00:16.469" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.208" end="00:17.447">She's so pretty, really</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.447" end="00:20.387">Trust your type 'til you miss me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.387" end="00:22.912">Think she's worth your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.912" end="00:28.989">And it hits me that I'll never be your wife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.989" end="00:30.489" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.487" end="00:34.419">But, darlin', I hope it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.419" end="00:38.611">When you try to forget me, oh, I hope that it burns</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.611" end="00:41.957">Baby, I was first</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.957" end="00:46.054">I hope you think of my lips, darling, when you're kissing hers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.054" end="00:47.554" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.231" end="00:53.566">And I hope that it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.566" end="00:58.994">And I hope that it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.994" end="01:02.487" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.487" end="01:05.329">You act so cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.329" end="01:09.912">'Til the second I started doin' better than you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.912" end="01:13.333">That smile is cruel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.333" end="01:17.900">'Cause you only loved me when I am worshiping you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.900" end="01:19.400" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.103" end="01:20.479">She's so pretty, really</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.479" end="01:23.483">Trust your type 'til you miss me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.483" end="01:26.195">Think she's worth your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.195" end="01:31.781">And it hits me that I'll never be your wife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.781" end="01:33.281" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.870" end="01:37.301">But, darlin', I hope it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.301" end="01:42.074">When you try to forget me, oh, I hope that it burns</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.074" end="01:44.721">Baby, I was first</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.721" end="01:48.838">I hope you think of my lips, darling, when you're kissing hers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.838" end="01:50.338" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.977" end="01:56.520">And I hope that it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.520" end="02:04.405">And I hope that it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.405" end="02:12.134">And I hope that it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.134" end="02:16.134">And I hope that it hurts</p></div></body></tt>